# Gregtech Grindless: values that differ from FTB Essentials' defaults (copied into each new world's serverconfig/ftbessentials.snbt).
# Homes: travel between planets is free on purpose (DECISIONS.md 2026-10-24); one home per base (Earth, the Moon, later planets)
# needs more than the default single home. Teleports have no cost and no dimension blacklist.
{
	teleportation: {
		home: {
			max: 10
		}
	}
}
